    Erza Showcase: public single-page editorial view.

    Mounted at /erza by controllers/main.py (the erza module). The client-side JS
    fetches /erza/api/dataset for the seeded paired-Δ data (glance, tiers, model
    table, matrix, and the dataset viewer with its headline KPIs).

    Erza measures Agent-Skills efficacy via PAIRED evaluation: the same task
    is run twice on the same model / harness / container - once with the
    curated Skill injected, once without - and the reported result is the
    paired difference Δ. All DOM ids/classes are preserved for erza_portal.js
    hooks; charts plot placeholder figures pending the first public delivery.
  -->
